{"id":"vod_sn_37804","vodId":"37804","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我女友与青梅竹马的惨烈修罗场","name_cn":"我女友与青梅竹马的惨烈修罗场","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f7cfdc0a0c98e3562f1f851e9480f987.jpg"},"summary":"对于高中生季堂锐太（逢坂良太 配音）来说，正确的时间里就应该做正确的事情，人人憧憬的恋爱简直是无稽之谈，学习和成绩才是重中之重。就是这样古板的男人，和青梅竹马春咲千和（赤崎千夏 配音）过着平静又充实的每一天。别看锐太如此正派，初中时的他确实个纯正的中二少年，病重的他甚至 会把自己的幻想写在笔记本上。没想到，就是这本笔记本，让他沦为了学院中公认的白富美夏川真凉（田村由加莉 配音）随意使唤的“奴隶”。　　应真凉的“要求”，锐太成为了她的男朋友。至此之后，个性内向的“前女友”秋篠姬香（金元寿子 配音）和坦诚耿直的“未婚妻”冬海爱衣（茅野爱衣 配音）也接连出现在了锐太的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1NsN7iNB4K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7nNGZD6KmA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L6Hxv5ad8Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L6MgSFzYr21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0wm6zQ7pAk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GYQyyEzde31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dy0ijQSEx91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mCYSUrhhR91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s8PHhR2rNc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U8jJa9wgdu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DR1epEfrkY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1spxeHeJf31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CLM90ATz601/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.345Z"}